#showas:胡言乱语
Jibber Jabber is a successor to the Royal Pains scenario.  The setup is similar, but a bit higher AI difficulty at 8 each, and the AI types feature some of the toughest from the expansions.  

Skirmisher AI makes border aggression more dangerous, but more importantly uses Venators which are available in all games but default to not being included.  Venators are powerful ships roughly similar to Guardians that excel in countering certain types of ships, so beware of putting all your eggs in one basket.  

Jabberwock on the other hand is merely generally considered to be the toughest AI in the game.  It has access to all of the most dangerous ships from other factions and can make effective wave defense in particular a pipe dream in some cases.  

The AIs being set to 8 is meant to give you a chance, but expect your skills to be given a stern test here.  

’Twas brillig, and the slithy toves
Did gyre and gimble in the wabe:
All mimsy were the borogoves,
And the mome raths outgrabe.'